# Quicksand Whirlpool, no discount: Bot1's own Ornithopter is untapped, so the spell costs the full {5}{W} (CR 601.2f): five Moxen alone are not
# enough (the cast is refused), with a Plains the six mana pay exactly and the pool is empty. "Target creature" is not limited to the opponent's
# (CR 115.1): Bot1's own creature is exiled, and Bot2's Ornithopter stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Quicksand Whirlpool
Plains
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
